  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "5dacb8bb98b2aa9a",
      "translationZh": "Grok 4.7 在 Artificial Analysis Intelligence Index 上得分 46，使 SpaceXAI 进入前四名 AI 实验室。 Coding Agent Index 表现也有所提升，超越 GPT-5.6 Sol。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "35121b93ab1f0dfc",
      "translationZh": "Grok 4.7 在 Intelligence Index 上比 Grok 4.6 高出 +2 分，在 agentic knowledge work 任务上表现强劲。我们在 xhigh 推理强度下评估了新模型。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "de27668db9c6384d",
      "translationZh": "➤ Grok 4.7 加入 agentic knowledge work 的前沿：Grok 4.7 在 AA-Briefcase（高）上相比 Grok 4.6 获得 +111 Elo，得分 1657 Elo，仅次于 Claude Opus 5 和 Claude Fable 5.1，位于前沿。在 GDPval-AA 上，其得分为 1695 Elo，领先 Grok 4.6（高）+90。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "38a158543ac0ee50",
      "translationZh": "➤ 编码代理表现实现飞跃：Grok 4.7（xhigh）配合 Grok Build 在 Artificial Analysis Coding Agent Index 上得分 56，较 Grok 4.6（xhigh）提升 +9 分。在原生 harness 中的模型中，Grok 4.7 + Grok Build 排名第四，仅落后于 Claude Fable 5.1、GPT-6 Astra 和 Claude Opus 5。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "816b8c99ca40ea25",
      "translationZh": "➤ 其他方面的增量性能变化：在 agentic knowledge work 之外，Grok 4.7 在其他 Intelligence Index 任务上基本与 Grok 4.6（高）持平。它在 Terminal-Bench 4.0 上提升了 +4.5 百分点，在 GDP.pdf 上提升了 +3.0 p.p.，但在 AA-LCR 上出现 -3.7 p.p. 的回退，在 AutomationBench-AA 上出现 -1.1 p.p. 的回退。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "523ad580ed695e59",
      "translationZh": "➤ 高 token 使用跨任务：Grok 4.7 的进步伴随着更高的 token 使用量。Grok 4.7（xhigh）每 Intelligence Index 任务大约使用 81k 输出 token，而 Grok 4.6（high）为 36k，GPT-6 Astra（max）为 27k——分别多出 125% 和 196%。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "59882ffc64a3b5b9",
      "translationZh": "➤ 上下文窗口为 500k token，与 Grok 4.6 保持一致。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "97be626fc2144b35",
      "translationZh": "➤ 定价为每 1M 输入/输出 token 2/6，缓存命中时折扣至每 1M token 0.50，与 Grok 4.6 保持一致。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "354fb34c49ba7061",
      "translationZh": "➤ 可配置的推理工作量从低到 xhigh。我们的评估使用 xhigh。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "03732e5be619f8c1",
      "translationZh": "Grok 4.7 加入了代理知识工作任务的前沿。在 AA-Briefcase 上，该基准评估模型在现实专业工作任务上的表现，Grok 4.7 得分 1657 Elo，比 Grok 4.6 (high) 高 111 分，仅次于 Claude Opus 5 和 Claude Fable 5.1。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c26545577ac53675",
      "translationZh": "Grok 4.7 的提升主要源于分析质量：其在分析质量上得分 1994 Elo，在呈现质量上得分 1499，而 Grok 4.6 (high) 分别为 1690 和 1519。AA-Briefcase 还会检查提交是否满足每项任务的需求，从完成分析到生成所需交付物。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "59b9277ac12cbfd8",
      "translationZh": "在 GDPval-AA 上，Grok 4.7 得分 1695 Elo，而 Grok 4.6 (high) 得分 1605。这些任务要求模型生成实际工作产出，如文档、电子表格和幻灯片。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0351a4ccf8f788ee",
      "translationZh": "使用 Grok 4.7 (xhigh) 的 Grok Build 在 Artificial Analysis Coding Agent Index 上得分 56，而使用 Grok 4.6 (xhigh) 时得分为 47。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "821701c66b94fc84",
      "translationZh": "它在三个组件上均有提升：DeepSWE v1.1 从 65% 提升至 73%，Terminal-Bench 4.0 从 18% 提升至 33%，SWE-Atlas-QnA 从 58% 提升至 63%。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "97377875cf42663e",
      "translationZh": "这些结果评估了 Grok 与其首方编码代理 Grok Build。它们与 Intelligence Index 结果独立，后者标准化了跨模型使用的评估 harness。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b3310e562d3d45c7",
      "translationZh": "Grok 4.7 的提升伴随着更高的 token 使用量。Grok 4.7 (xhigh) 在 Intelligence Index 上得分 46，每任务使用 81k 输出 token，几乎是 Grok 4.6 (xhigh) 使用的 38k 的两倍多。这与 Muse Spark 1.3 (max) 的 60k 和 GPT-6 Astra (max) 的 27k 相比。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5b6406a97b056b45",
      "translationZh": "我们的性能测量显示，Grok 4.7 在长提示下的答案输出速度约为 188 tokens/秒。Grok 4.7 在 Intelligence Index 任务上的平均耗时约为 7.1 分钟。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0024c788960fb9d5",
      "translationZh": "Grok 4.7 (xhigh) 的 AA-Omniscience 幻觉率低于 Grok 4.6 (high)：29% 对比 34%。准确率基本保持不变，为 47% 对比 48%，整体 AA-Omniscience 指数从 30 提升至 32。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a97ad9169fac3a8c",
      "translationZh": "Grok 4.7 (xhigh)、Grok 4.6 (high) 以及其他领先模型的完整 Intelligence Index 评估细分。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "72a723ca0185d7c0",
      "translationZh": "蚂蚁集团发布金融聚焦的 Ling-3.0-flash-Fin",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "64b40b78f0fd14dc",
      "translationZh": "蚂蚁集团已发布其金融聚焦的闪存模型 Ling-3.0-flash-Fin",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0a8906d9b36ccd4c",
      "translationZh": "宣布人工分析能力指数 v1.1",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "40693e6f6620c42a",
      "translationZh": "我们正在添加来自 AutomationBench-AA、AA-Briefcase 的 Agentic Tool Use 到 Agentic Knowledge Work，并将 GDP.pdf 加入 Long-Context。能力指数 v1.1 使每个指数更贴近其所覆盖的工作，将我们核心 Intelligence Index v4.3 评估的切片与专门评估相结合。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b2a47bb49b68e45c",
      "translationZh": "基准测试 GPT-6 Astra",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dd262771b8674f78",
      "translationZh": "GPT-6 Astra 与 Claude Fable 5.1 在我们两大旗舰指数中并列领先，成本更低。Astra 在 Intelligence Index 中与 Fable 5.1 持平，成本约为 40%；在 Coding Agent Index 中与 Fable 5.1 持平，成本约为 60%。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    }
  ],
